1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:13,450
Slide 3 establishes our "CORE MISSION & MOTTO: Soli Deo Gloria—Glory to God Alone." Notice the three foundational principles displayed across our screen.

2
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:19,274
Principle 1 is Our Mandate: Elevating human mind and spirit above mechanical work.

3
00:00:19,274 --> 00:00:26,460
Human beings were created in the image of God with creativity, compassion, strategic judgment, and spiritual depth.

4
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:33,710
We were never designed to spend eight hours a day doing mechanical copy-pasting between disconnected software tools.

5
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:42,122
Principle 2 defines Technology's Role: Technology is a tool to serve humans, not a master to control us.

6
00:00:42,122 --> 00:00:52,059
In our modern digital landscape, addictive algorithms, endless notification bells, and dopamine loops constantly fragment human focus.

7
00:00:52,059 --> 00:00:59,180
As Intelligence Architects, we must establish absolute sovereignty over our digital environment.

8
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:06,165
And Principle 3 is our Wisdom Goal: Automating simple tasks to save precious time for higher purpose.

9
00:01:06,165 --> 00:01:18,240
When your personal AI avatar handles routine administrative workflows, you reclaim hours every week to invest in deep intellectual work, family presence, faith, and serving your local community.

10
00:01:18,940 --> 00:01:24,874
Automation without moral wisdom leads to distraction and spiritual exhaustion.

11
00:01:24,874 --> 00:01:30,580
But automation grounded in Soli Deo Gloria becomes sacred time stewardship.

12
00:01:30,580 --> 00:01:34,080
That is the core standard of Oikos University.

